# Force LF on scripts. A CRLF checkout on Windows breaks the
# `#!/usr/bin/env bash` shebang (bash chokes on the trailing `\r`) and
# corrupts Python hooks run through Git Bash. These types must stay LF
# regardless of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
